ado na sala e nos quartos e porcelanato preto na cozinha e nos banheiros;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; z-index: 2;\">- Sol da manhã;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; z-index: 2;\">- Frente para rua;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; z-index: 2;\">- 2 vagas cobertas na garagem.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; z-index: 2;\">Entrega com alguns móveis, sendo eles: Armários da cozinha e dos quartos, Rack e painel da sala, armários e lavatórios dos banheiros e prateleiras da área de serviço.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; z-index: 2;\">Condomínio fechado com:</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; z-index: 2;\">- Academia;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, 