('1202', 'C3398', 'Jd. Morumbi - Sobrado 5D(Suíte e escritório); 2 Banheiros; Quintal; Área Gourmet; 2 Vgs', 'xc3398', '2', '1', '', '<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Sobrado localizado no Jardim Morumbi próximo à praça da Mangueira, com quadra poliesportiva e playground. Há 400m do supermercado Nagumo, e da Faculdade Anhanguera, e somente há 3km do Anel Viário, localização privilegiada.</span></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">150m2 Área útil </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Terreno 6x25 </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">2 Banheiros </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Móveis Planejados em todos os banheiros </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Cozinha americana com móveis planejados </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">5 Quartos, sendo um para escritório </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">3 andares </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Quarto master com closet. </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Portão eletrônico </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Garagem para 2 carros </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Casa conceito aberto </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Pé direito Duplo, de 7m </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Área Gourmet, com churrasqueira e móveis planejados </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Toldo para proteção de sol e chuva na área gourmet </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Piso vinílico e laminado </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Quarto 5 com ar-condicionado </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Iluminação da casa toda em Led </span></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Casa documentada e disponível para financiamentos </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Estuda proposta de permuta.</span></p>\r\n<p> </p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery1\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3398 1.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3398 1.jpg\"},\"gallery6\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3398 6.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3398 6.jpg\"},\"gallery2\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3398 2.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3398 2.jpg\"},\"gallery4\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3398 4.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3398 4.jpg\"},\"gallery8\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3398 8.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3398 8.jpg\"},\"gallery10\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3398 10.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3398 10.jpg\"},\"gallery14\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3398 14.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3398 14.jpg\"},\"gallery7\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3398 7.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3398 7.jpg\"},\"gallery3\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3398 3.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3398 3.jpg\"},\"gallery11\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3398 11.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3398 11.jpg\"},\"gallery9\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3398 9.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3398 9.jpg\"},\"gallery13\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3398 13.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3398 13.jpg\"},\"gallery12\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3398 12.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3398 12.jpg\"},\"gallery5\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3398 5.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3398 5.jpg\"}}', 'sell', '', '580000.00', '', '', 'BRL:R$', '1', 'show', '12', 'BR', 'São José dos C