('1206', 'C3399', 'Bosque Dos Ipês - Sobrado 3D(Suíte) - 3 Andares; 5 Banheiros; Quintal; Armários na Cozinha; 3 Vgs', 'xc3399', '7', '1', '', '<p>Sobrado à venda no bairro Bosque do Ipês: </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>- Sobrado 3 pisos ( 300 m2 área construída)</p>\r\n<p>- garagem para 3 carros</p>\r\n<p>- área comercial com banheiro, na frente ( salão de cabeleireiro);</p>\r\n<p>- sala de estar;</p>\r\n<p>- copa, cozinha;</p>\r\n<p>- área de serviço ;</p>\r\n<p>- 3 quartos grandes, sendo 1 suíte;</p>\r\n<p>- no terceiro piso área de festas. Com linda vista. </p>\r\n<p>- total de 5 banheiros (somente 3 acabados).</p>\r\n<p>- Piso Frio;</p>\r\n<p> </p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery2\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3399 1.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3399 1.jpg\"},\"gallery3\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3399 2.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3399 2.jpg\"},\"gallery5\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3399 4.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3399 4.jpg\"},\"gallery14\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3399 13.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3399 13.jpg\"},\"gallery11\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3399 10.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3399 10.jpg\"},\"gallery9\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3399 8.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3399 8.jpg\"},\"gallery13\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3399 12.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3399 12.jpg\"},\"gallery8\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3399 7.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3399 7.jpg\"},\"gallery15\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3399 14.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3399 14.jpg\"},\"gallery4\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3399 3.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3399 3.jpg\"},\"gallery12\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3399 11.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3399 11.jpg\"},\"gallery10\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3399 9.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3399 9.jpg\"},\"gallery20\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3399 19.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3399 19.jpg\"},\"gallery16\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3399 15.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3399 15.jpg\"},\"gallery7\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3399 6.jpg\"