('1226', 'C3409', 'Jd. Santo Onofre - Sobrado 3D(Suíte); 2 Banheiros; Cozinha planejada; Armários embutidos; Portão automático; 2 Vgs', 'xc3409', '2', '1', '', '<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Jardim Santo Onofre - Sobrado de 118m² à venda com: </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- 3 Dormitórios, sendo 1 suíte;</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- 2 Banheiros;</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- Armários planejados nos 3 quartos;</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- Armários e espelhos nos banheiros;</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- Cozinha Planejada com Fogão e Coifa embutidos;</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- Sala com Painel embutido</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- Área de serviço coberta;</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- Quintal;</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- Churrasqueira;</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- Sala, cozinha e corredor com piso em porcelanato; </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- Quartos com piso laminado;</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- 2 Vagas de garagem cobertas com portão automático;</span></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Área do terreno: 125m²</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Estuda permuta por casas nos bairros </span><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Vila Industrial, Jd. Paulista, Jd. Ismênia, Vila Tatetuba, Santana, Vila Maria e Centro;</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">a 50mts da UBS, 300mts do UPA, próximo a escolas, supermercados, praças e farmácias.</span></span></p>\r\n<p> </p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery1\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3409 1.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3409 1.jpg\"},\"gallery2\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3409 2.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3409 2.jpg\"},\"gallery6\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3409 6.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3409 6.jpg\"},\"gallery7\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3409 7.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3409 7.jpg\"},\"gallery5\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3409 5.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3409 5.jpg\"},\"gallery8\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3409 8.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3409 8.jpg\"},\"gallery4\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3409 4.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3409 4.jpg\"},\"gallery10\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3409 10.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3409 10.jpg\"},\"gallery11\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3409 11.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3409 11.jpg\"},\"gallery13\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3409 13.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3409 13.jpg\"},\"gallery3\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3409 3.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3409 3.jpg\"},\"gallery12\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3409 12.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3409 12.jpg\"},\"gallery9\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3409 9.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3409 9.jpg\"},\"gallery15\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3409 15.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3409 15.jpg\"},\"gallery14\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3409 14.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3409 14.jpg\"},\"gallery16\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3409 16.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3409 16.jpg\"},\"gallery17\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3409 17.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3409 17.jpg\"},\"gallery18\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3409 18.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3409 18.jpg\"}}', 'sell', '', '375000.00', '', '', 'BRL:R$', '1', 'show', '12', 'BR', 'São José dos Campos', 'Jd. Santo Onofre', '-23.248495,-45.831942', '12228009', '125', '3', '2', '2', '', '0', '[\"8\",\"12\",\"27\"]', '', '', '', '{}', '1', '*', '1', '0', '783', '2022-06-02 00:00:00', '783', '2022-06-03 16:57:05', '0', NULL),
