('1233', 'A7808', 'Parque Industrial - Apto 2D; 1 WC; Sol da Manhã; 1 Vg Coberta', 'xa7808', '1', '1', '', '<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Parque Industrial - Apto. de 44m² com:</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">- 2 Dormitórios;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">- 1 Banheiro;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">- Sol da manhã;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">- Piso laminado;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">- 1 Vaga na garagem.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Em cond. fechado com portaria 24h, segurança e área de lazer:</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">- Quadra poliesportiva;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">- Salão de festas;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: