('1239', 'M1495', 'Jd. São Dimas - Sala Comercial 30m², Piso em porcelanato;', 'xm1495', '3', '1', '', '<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Sala comercial de 30m² à venda no bairro Jd. São Dimas.</span></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- São dois ambientes, ambos com piso em porcelanato.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- Pintura nova com painel marmorizado. </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- Edifício tranquilo, onde seu cliente se sentirá respeitado e acolhido. </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- Existe a opção de venda da sala ao lado também, aumentando para 55 m2. </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- Totalmente quitada e escriturada. </span></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\"><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">O Bairro São Dimas, é composto de residências, escritórios, restaurantes e comércio em geral.</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\"><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Em frente à uma aconchegante praça, com fácil estacionamento durante todo o dia.</span></span></p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery1\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/M1495 1.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"M1495 1.jpg\"},\"gallery11\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/M1495 11.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"M1495 11.jpg\"},\"gallery3\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/M1495 3.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"M1495 3.jpg\"},\"gallery9\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/M1495 9.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"M1495 9.jpg\"},\"gallery2\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/M1495 2.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"M1495 2.jpg\"},\"gallery6\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/M1495 6.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"M1495 6.jpg\"},\"gallery8\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/M1495 8.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"M1495 8.jpg\"},\"gallery7\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/M1495 7.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"M1495 7.jpg\"},\"gallery5\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/M1495 5.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"M1495 5.jpg\"},\"gallery4\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/M1495 4.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"M1495 4.jpg\"},\"gallery10\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/M1495 10.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"M1495 10.jpg\"},\"gallery12\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/M1495 12.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"M1495 12.jpg\"}}', 'sell', '', '170000.00', '', '', 'BRL:R$', '1', 'show', '12', 'BR', 'São José dos Campos', 'Jd. São Dimas', '-23.195646,-45.889570', '12245190', '30', '0', '0', '0', '', '0', NULL, '', '', '', '{}', '1', '*', '1', '0', '783', '2022-06-11 00:00:00', '783', '2022-06-30 17:31:36', '0', NULL),
