('1248', 'A7816', 'Jd das Indústrias - Apto 3D (Suíte); 3 Banheiros; Sacada Gourmet; Mobiliado; Ar Cond; 2 Vgs c/ Hobby Box', 'xa7816', '1', '1', '', '<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; z-index: 2; color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-line;\">Apartamento p</span><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-line;\">rojetado por arquiteta renomada </span><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-line;\">à venda no bairro Jd. Das Indústrias com:</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; z-index: 2; color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-line;\">- 3 quartos, sendo 2 suítes;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; z-index: 2; color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-line;\">- 1 banheiro social;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; z-index: 2; color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-line;\">- Completamente mobiliado</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; z-index: 2; color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-line;\">- Cozinha planejada</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; z-index: 2; color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-line;\">- Armários embutidos</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; z-index: 2; color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-line;\">- Todas as portas de correr e armários dos quartos laqueados.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; z-index: 2; color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-line;\">- </span><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-line;\">Ar condicionado na sala e em dois quartos.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; z-index: 2; color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-line;\">- </span><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-line;\">Varanda gourmet fechada com vidro e cortina.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">- <span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-line;\">Projeto de gesso em todos ambientes.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; z-index: 2; color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-line;\">- Área de serviço</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-line;\">- Pisos em porcelanato Portobello nas áreas comuns e em madeira natural nos dormitórios.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; z-index: 2; color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-line;\">- Garagem para 2 Carros com Hobby Box</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Permitido animais. Condomínio com Elevador, Segurança 24h e Lazer completo, sendo:</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Piscina, Academia, Playground, Quadra Poliesportiva, Salão de Festas, Salão de Jogos, Área Gourmet;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Estuda permuta em até 400mil;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"> </p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery1\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7816 1.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7816 1.jpg\"},\"gallery5\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7816 5.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7816 5.jpg\"},\"gallery7\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7816 7.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7816 7.jpg\"},\"gallery9\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7816 9.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7816 9.jpg\"},\"gallery6\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7816 6.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7816 6.jpg\"},\"gallery8\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7816 8.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7816 8.jpg\"},\"gallery11\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7816 11.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7816 11.jpg\"},\"gallery2\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7816 2.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7816 2.jpg\"},\"gallery3\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7816 3.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7816 3.jpg\"},\"gallery12\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7816 12.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7816 12.jpg\"},\"gallery14\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7816 14.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7816 14.jpg\"},\"gallery4\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7816 4.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7