('1268', 'C2192', 'Jd. Bela Vista- Sobrado geminado 3 quartos (suite), sacada, 2 vgs garagem', 'xc2192', '7', '1', '', '<p>Sobrado geminado de 3 dormitórios sendo uma suite com armários e sacada, sala com lavabo, cozinha com gabinete e armários, piso em cerâmica e laminados, 2 vagas de garagem. Bom para investimento, imóvel alugado.</p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery3\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C2192 3.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C2192 3.jpeg\"},\"gallery4\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C2192 4.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C2192 4.jpeg\"},\"gallery2\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C2192 2.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C2192 2.jpeg\"},\"gallery1\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C2192 1.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C2192 1.jpeg\"},\"gallery5\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C2192 5.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C2192 5.jpeg\"},\"gallery6\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C2192 6.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C2192 6.jpeg\"},\"gallery7\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C2192 7.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C2192 7.jpeg\"},\"gallery10\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C2192 10.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C2192 10.jpeg\"},\"gallery8\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C2192 8.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C2192 8.jpeg\"},\"gallery9\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C2192 9.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C2192 9.jpeg\"},\"gallery14\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C2192 14.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C2192 14.jpeg\"},\"gallery12\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C2192 12.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C2192 12.jpeg\"},\"gallery15\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C2192 15.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C2192 15.jpeg\"},\"gallery11\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C2192 11.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C2192 11.jpeg\"},\"gallery13\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C2192 13.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C2192 13.jpeg\"},\"gallery16\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C2192 16.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C2192 16.jpeg\"},\"gallery18\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C2192 18.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C2192 18.jpeg\"},\"gallery17\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C2192 17.jpeg\",\"alt_te