('1432', 'A7902', 'Jd. Satélite - Apto 3D (Suíte); 2 Banheiros; Sacada; Móveis Planejados; 2 Vgs', 'xa7902', '1', '1', '', '<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">72m²</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Todos os ambientes com móveis planejados novos,</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">menos de um ano de uso.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Três quartos, sendo uma suíte.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Ar-condicionado novo em todos os quartos e sala.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Vista definitiva e sol da manhã, andar alto.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Excelente localização, rua tranquila, condomínio com</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">valor acessível, água incluso no valor do condomínio.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Chuveiros elétricos.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Gás encanado na cozinha.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Possui elevadores</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Possui salão de festas, espaço infantil e salão de jogos. </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\"> Duas vagas de garagem coberta.</span></p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery1\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7902 1.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7902 1.jpg\"},\"gallery9\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7902 12.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7902 12.jpg\"},\"gallery7\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7902 10.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7902 10.jpg\"},\"gallery5\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7902 8.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7902 8.jpg\"},\"gallery11\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7902 2.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7902 2.jpg\"},\"gallery4\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7902 7.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7902 7.jpg\"},\"gallery6\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7902 9.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7902 9.jpg\"},\"gallery2\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7902 5.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7902 5.jpg\"},\"gallery10\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7902 13.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7902 13.jpg\"},\"gallery13\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7902 4.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7902 4.jpg\"},\"gallery8\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7902 11.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7902 11.jpg\"},\"gallery12\"