('1449', 'M1499', 'Cidade Morumbi - Casa/Comercial 2D; 2 Banheiros; Piso Frio; 2 Vagas', 'xm1499', '3', '1', '', '<p class=\"ad__sc-1kv8vxj-0 jWWQbF\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin: 0px; margin-block: 0px; display: flex; position: relative;\"><span class=\"ad__sc-1sj3nln-1 fMgwdS sc-ifAKCX cmFKIN\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: #4a4a4a; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; word-break: break-word;\">Casa Morumbi ótima para morar e investir. Tem dois pontos comerciais que podem gerar renda de 1200,00 </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"ad__sc-1kv8vxj-0 jWWQbF\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin: 0px; margin-block: 0px; display: flex; position: relative;\"><span class=\"ad__sc-1sj3nln-1 fMgwdS sc-ifAKCX cmFKIN\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: #4a4a4a; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; word-break: break-word;\">Casa 150m² zona sul de São José dos Campos no cidade Morumbi </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"ad__sc-1kv8vxj-0 jWWQbF\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin: 0px; margin-block: 0px; display: flex; position: relative;\"><span class=\"ad__sc-1sj3nln-1 fMgwdS sc-ifAKCX cmFKIN\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: #4a4a4a; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; word-break: break-word;\">Com escritura e habite-se de comércio </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"ad__sc-1kv8vxj-0 jWWQbF\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin: 0px; margin-block: 0px; display: flex; position: relative;\"><span class=\"ad__sc-1sj3nln-1 fMgwdS sc-ifAKCX cmFKIN\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: #4a4a4a; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; word-break: break-word;\">Jd Morumbi de frente para duas praças bem arborizadas e iluminadas 2 dormitórios para casal e solteiro (família) </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"ad__sc-1kv8vxj-0 jWWQbF\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin: 0px; margin-block: 0px; display: flex; position: relative;\"><span class=\"ad__sc-1sj3nln-1 fMgwdS sc-ifAKCX cmFKIN\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: #4a4a4a; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; word-break: break-word;\">Ampla Sala com revestimento, Banheiro com box, Hall. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"ad__sc-1kv8vxj-0 jWWQbF\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin: 0px; margin-block: 0px; display: flex; position: relative;\"><span class=\"ad__sc-1sj3nln-1 fMgwdS sc-ifAKCX cmFKIN\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: #4a4a4a; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; word-break: break-word;\">Cozinha com gabinete e pia, Churrasqueira novíssima. Área de serviço com dois tanques de lavar roupas, Garagem.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"ad__sc-1kv8vxj-0 jWWQbF\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin: 0px; margin-block: 0px; display: flex; position: relative;\"><span class=\"ad__sc-1sj3nln-1 fMgwdS sc-ifAKCX cmFKIN\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: #4a4a4a; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; word-break: break-word;\">Possui colunas para construir um sobrado </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"ad__sc-1kv8vxj-0 jWWQbF\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin: 0px; margin-block: 0px; display: flex; position: relative;\"><span class=\"ad__sc-1sj3nln-1 fMgwdS sc-ifAKCX cmFKIN\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: #4a4a4a; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; word-break: break-word;\">2 pontos comerciais todos reformados pintados, habite-se comercial 28m² </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"ad__sc-1kv8vxj-0 jWWQbF\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin: 0px; margin-block: 0px; display: flex; position: relative;\"><span class=\"ad__sc-1sj3nln-1 fMgwdS sc-ifAKCX cmFKIN\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: #4a4a4a; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; word-break: break-word;\">Tanque, gabinete, portas de vidro e de pvc Fachada Luzes de emergência Luz e água separadas da residência Alarme </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"ad__sc-1kv8vxj-0 jWWQbF\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin: 0px; margin-block: 0px; display: flex; position: relative;\"> </p>\r\n<p class=\"ad__sc-1kv8vxj-0 jWWQbF\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin: 0px; margin-block: 0px; display: flex; position: relative;\"><span class=\"ad__sc-1sj3nln-1 fMgwdS sc-ifAKCX cmFKIN\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: #4a4a4a; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; word-break: break-word;\">Ótima oportunidade de investimento(para consultórios dentro do drywal, pontos de água para sala de estética, salão de beleza, loja de salgados e outros demais tipos de comércio) Banheiro, Lavabos com gabinetes novos Porta papéis e espelhos Casa toda em piso frio Próxima a linha verde Próximo ao shopping oriente e supermercados( Shibata, mercado dia, Nagumo e Coop).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"ad__sc-1kv8vxj-0 jWWQbF\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin: 0px; margin-block: 0px; display: flex; position: relative;\"> </p>\r\n<p class=\"ad__sc-1kv8vxj-0 jWWQbF\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin: 0px; margin-block: 0px; display: flex; position: relative;\"><span class=\"ad__sc-1sj3nln-1 f