('1451', 'T1187', 'Terreno de 378m² no Condomínio Verana', 'xt1187', '6', '1', '', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #4a4a4a; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Excelente terreno no Condomínio Residencial Verana na parte mais reservada e tranquila do condomínio.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #4a4a4a; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #4a4a4a; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Terreno quitado e pronto pra construir. excelente investimento na região onde mais cresce em São José dos Campos.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #4a4a4a; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Frente com 13,62 m e fundos 27,74 m, total de 377,84 m2.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font