('1507', 'C3518', 'Urbanova-Monte Carlo/Sobrado 4Dormitórios (4stes), piscina, 4 vgs garagem', 'xc3518', '7', '1', '', '<p><span class=\"ad__sc-1sj3nln-1 fMgwdS sc-ifAKCX cmFKIN\">Sobrado no Condominio Monte Carlo com área de 270m2 e terreno de 450m2. São 4 dormitórios, sendo todos com suítes, Sala de Estar, Sala Jogos, cozinha, área de serviço, lavabo, área gourmet com piscina, 4 vagas de garagem. Condomínio com Lazer: Piscina adulto e infantil, Parque Infantil,  Academia, Salão de festa, Quadra de tênis, Sauna.Condomínio e R$ 650,00 e IPTU R$ 1.900,00<br /></span></p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery2\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3518 2.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3518 2.jpg\"},\"gallery1\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3518 1.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3518 1.jpg\"},\"gallery3\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3518 3.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3518 3.jpg\"},\"gallery4\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3518 4.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3518 4.jpg\"},\"gallery5\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3518 5.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3518 5.jpg\"},\"gallery7\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3518 8.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3518 8.jpg\"},\"gallery6\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3518 7.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3518 7.jpg\"},\"gallery12\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3518 14.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3518 14.jpg\"},\"gallery9\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3518 10.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3518 10.jpg\"},\"gallery11\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3518 13.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3518 13.jpg\"},\"gallery8\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3518 9.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3518 9.jpg\"},\"gallery10\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3518 11.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3518 11.jpg\"},\"gallery13\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3518 15.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3518 15.jpg\"},\"gallery14\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3518 16.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3518 16.jpg\"},\"gallery15\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3518 6.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3518 6.jpg\"},\"gallery16\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C351