('1530', 'C3532', 'Jd. das Indústrias-Casa geminada de 2 dormitórios (suite), armário, 2 vagas garagem cobertas', 'xc3532', '7', '1', '', '<p>Casa geminada de 87 m2 de área útil e 125m2 de terreno no Jd das Industrias com dois quartos sendo uma suite, armário embutido, janelas em madeira, piso frio, box de vidro nos banheiros e duas vagas cobertas de garagem. </p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery1\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3532 1.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3532 1.jpg\"},\"gallery7\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3532 7.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3532 7.jpg\"},\"gallery2\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3532 2.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3532 2.jpg\"},\"gallery6\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3532 6.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3532 6.jpg\"},\"gallery5\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3532 5.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3532 5.jpg\"},\"gallery4\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3532 4.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3532 4.jpg\"},\"gallery8\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3532 8.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3532 8.jpg\"},\"gallery3\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3532 3.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3532 3.jpg\"},\"gallery9\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3532 9.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3532 9.jpg\"},\"gallery10\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3532 10.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3532 10.jpg\"},\"gallery11\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3532 11.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3532 11.jpg\"}}', 'sell', '', '600000.00', '', '', 'BRL:R$', '1', 'show', '12', 'BR', 'SJCampos', 'Jd das Indústrias', '-23.231783,-45.923514', '12241250', '87', '2', '2', '2', '', '0', '[\"8\"]', '', '', '', '{}', '1', '*', '1', '0', '783', '2023-06-16 00:00:00', '783', '2025-11-12 11:51:10', '0', NULL),
('1538', 'C3538', 'Jd Alvorada- casa lote inteiro, 205m2 AC e 250m2 AT, 3 dorms (suite), 2 vgs garagem', 'xc3538', '7', '1', '', '<p><span class=\"ad__sc-1sj3nln-1 fMgwdS sc-hSdWYo htqcWR\" data-ds-component=\"DS-Text\">Casa térrea com cômodos amplos, 250 m2 de terreno, 205 m2 de área construída, 3 dormitórios, sendo uma suíte, varanda, sala de estar, sala de jantar, cozinha e churrasqueira integradas, toda em porcelanato, área de serviço e quintal. </span></p>\r\n<p><span class=\"ad__sc-1sj3nln-1 fMgwdS sc-hSdWYo htqcWR\" data-ds-component=\"DS-Text\">Garagem coberta para dois carros. Edícula com 1 quarto, sala, cozinha, banheiro, área de serviço e churrasqueira. Muito bem localizada, a poucos metros da Avenida Cassiano Ricardo, amplo comércio, restaurantes, escolas, praças.</span></p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery1\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3538 1.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3538 1.jpg\"},\"gallery3\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3538 3.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3538 3.jpg\"},\"gallery2\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3538 2.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3538 2.jpg\"},\"gallery9\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3538 9.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3538 9.jpg\"},\"gallery11\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3538 11.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3538 11.jpg\"},\"gallery10\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3538 10.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3538 10.jpg\"},\"gallery7\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3538 7.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3538 7.jpg\"},\"gallery4\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3538 4.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3538 4.jpg\"},\"gallery8\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3538 8.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3538 8.jpg\"},\"gallery13\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3538 13.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3538 13.jpg\"},\"gallery5\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3538 5.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3538 5.jpg\"},\"gallery6\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3538 6.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3538 6.jpg\"},\"gallery12\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3538 12.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3538 12.jpg\"},\"gallery15\"