('1539', 'A7957', 'Jd. Oswaldo Cruz - Apto 53 m2 com 2 quartos(suite),armários, sacada, coz.plan, 1 vaga', 'xa7957', '1', '1', '', '<p><span class=\"ad__sc-1sj3nln-1 fMgwdS sc-VigVT jcyavR\" data-ds-component=\"DS-Text\">O apartamento está localizado no bairro Jardim Oswaldo Cruz com 53 metros quadrados com 2 quartos e 1 banheiro, sala com sacada, vista livre, cozinha planejda, 1 vaga de garagem. Possui área de fitness, playground, espaço para festas. Vai lhe possibilitar curtir os dias mais quentes na piscina, Churrasqueira para você aproveitar nos momentos de descontração. Bem próximo ao Centervale Shopping e Rodoviária. Elevador para mais praticidade no dia-a-dia.</span></p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery15\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A7957 1.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7957 1.jpg\"},\"gallery23\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A7957 9.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7957 9.jpg\"},\"gallery16\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A7957 2.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7957 2.jpg\"},\"gallery24\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A7957 10.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7957 10.jpg\"},\"gallery20\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A7957 6.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7957 6.jpg\"},\"gallery22\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A7957 8.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7957 8.jpg\"},\"gallery17\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A7957 3.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7957 3.jpg\"},\"gallery21\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A7957 7.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7957 7.jpg\"},\"gallery19\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A7957 5.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7957 5.jpg\"},\"gallery18\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A7957 4.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7957 4.jpg\"},\"gallery32\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A7957 18.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7957 18.jpg\"},\"gallery25\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A7957 11.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7957 11.jpg\"},\"gallery34\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A7957 20.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7957 20.jpg\"},\"gallery33\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A7957 19.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7957 19.jpg\"},\"gallery30\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A7957 16.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7957 1