('1540', 'A7963', 'Apto 73 m2, 3 quartos (suite), coz planejada, sala e sacada, 1 vaga garagem', 'xa7962', '1', '1', '', '<p><span class=\"ad__sc-1sj3nln-1 fMgwdS sc-bZQynM gXnDHl\" data-ds-component=\"DS-Text\">O apartamento está localizado no bairro Monte Castelo tem 73 metros quadrados com 3 quartos sendo 1 suite e 2 banheiros, cozinha planejada, sala com sacada, 1 vaga de garagem. Possui espaço para festas. Elevador para mais praticidade no dia-a-dia. Ótima localização, ao lado da Havan. Condominio de R$ 235 e IPTU 540,00<br /></span></p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery19\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7963 1.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7963 1.jpg\"},\"gallery20\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7963 2.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7963 2.jpg\"},\"gallery22\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7963 4.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7963 4.jpg\"},\"gallery21\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7963 3.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7963 3.jpg\"},\"gallery23\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7963 5.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7963 5.jpg\"},\"gallery33\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7963 15.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7963 15.jpg\"},\"gallery32\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7963 14.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7963 14.jpg\"},\"gallery34\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7963 16.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7963 16.jpg\"},\"gallery31\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7963 13.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7963 13.jpg\"},\"gallery30\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7963 12.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7963 12.jpg\"},\"gallery27\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7963 9.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7963 9.jpg\"},\"gallery29\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7963 11.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7963 11.jpg\"},\"gallery26\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7963 8.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7963 8.jpg\"},\"gallery28\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7963 10.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7963 10.jpg\"},\"gallery25\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7963 7.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7963 7.jpg\"},\"gallery24\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7963 6.jpg\",\"alt_t