('1579', 'C3547', 'Sobrado com 5 dormitórios à venda, 470 m² - Sala de estar com pé direito de 7mts / - Área gourmet integrada', 'xc3547', '7', '1', '', '<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\">O Condomínio Residencial Alphaville II é mais do que uma casa, é o seu santuário de tranquilidade e sofisticação, rodeado por áreas verdes deslumbrantes, confira os diferenciais:</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\">- 470m² Área construída / - 525m² Área terreno / - 5 suítes / - Sala de estar com pé direito de 7mts / - Área gourmet integrada / - Piscina / Vista permanente privilegiada para o lago e centro de SJC / -preparo para ar condicionado;</span></p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery1\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/IMG-20230913-WA0088.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"IMG-20230913-WA0088.jpg\"},\"gallery4\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/IMG-20230913-WA0091.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"IMG-20230913-WA0091.jpg\"},\"gallery3\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/IMG-20230913-WA0090.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"IMG-20230913-WA0090.jpg\"},\"gallery2\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/IMG-20230913-WA0089.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"IMG-20230913-WA0089.jpg\"},\"gallery5\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/IMG-20230913-WA0092.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"IMG-20230913-WA0092.jpg\"},\"gallery8\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/IMG-20230913-WA0095.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"IMG-20230913-WA0095.jpg\"},\"gallery7\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/IMG-20230913-WA0094.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"IMG-20230913-WA0094.jpg\"},\"gallery6\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/IMG-20230913-WA0093.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"IMG-20230913-WA0093.jpg\"}}', 'sell', '', '4900000.00', '', '', 'BRL:R$', '1', 'show', '12', 'BR', 'SÃO JOSÉ DOS CAMPOS', 'Alphaville II', '-23.18332196562374 ,-45.943131599999646', '', '470', '5', '6', '3', '', '0', '[\"8\",\"9\",\"12\",\"17\",\"27\"]', '', '', '', '{}', '1', '*', '1', '0', '783', '2023-09-09 00:00:00', '783', '2023-09-14 14:14:53', '0', NULL),
('1583', 'C3548', 'Urbanova - sobrado novo AC de 424 m2 com 4 quartos (4suites), 4 vagas de garagem', 'xc3548', '7', '1', '', '<h1 class=\"ad__sc-45jt43-0 htAiPK sc-jTzLTM iXcEhO\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; word-break: break-word; color: var(--text-color); font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold); line-height: var(--font-lineheight-medium); font-size: var(--font-size-lg);\" data-ds-component=\"DS-Text\"><span style=\"color: #1a1d23; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve-breaks;\">Diferenciais: sauna, infra de ar condicionado nos dormitórios, aquecedor solar de agua (600 litros), porcalanato1,20x1,20 no pavimento térreo, persianas, automatizadas suítes superiores, suite master com hidro e closet, iluminação toda executada, vista definitiva para serra da Mantiqueira. Pavimento terreo - 1 suíte, sala 3 ambientes integradas com cozinha, área gourmet, sala de cinema e uma bela piscina com cascata e vista privilegiada para Serra da Mantiqueira, lavabo, lavanderia, banheiro area gourmet, 2 vagas cobertas 2 vagas descobertas. Pavimento superior, 3 suítes amplas sendo uma master com closet e hidromassagem, mezanino e sacada com vista da serra. Pavimento subsolo espaço para academia, sauna, salão de jogos ou festa.</span></h1>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\">Condomínio </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\">R$650,00 IPTU </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\">R$3.000,00</span></p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery1\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3548 12.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3548 12.jpg\"},\"gallery2\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3548 14.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3548 14.jpg\"},\"gallery3\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3548 17.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3548 17.jpg\"},\"gallery5\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3548 4.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3548 4.jpg\"},\"gallery7\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3548 10.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3548 10.jpg\"},\"gallery4\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3548 1.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3548 1.jpg\"},\"gallery6\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3548 6.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3548 6.jpg\"},\"gallery13\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3548 18.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3548 18.jpg\"},\"gallery12\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3548 16.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3548 16.jpg\"},\"gallery9\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3548 7.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3548 7.jpg\"},\"gallery10\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3548 8.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3548 8.jpg\"},\"gallery8\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3548 3.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3548 3.jpg\"},\"gallery11\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3548 15.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3548 15.jpg\"},\"gallery15\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3548 5.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3548 5.jpg\"},\"gallery16\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3548 11.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3548 11.jpg\"},\"gallery17\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3548 13.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3548 13.jpg\"},\"gallery14\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3548 2.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3548 2.jpg\"},\"gallery18\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3548 9.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3548 9.jpg\"}}', 'sell', '', '2990000.00', '', '', 'BRL:R$', '1', 'show', '12', 'BR', 'SÃO JOSÉ DOS CAMPOS', 'Urbanova', '-23.184651,-45.950897', '', '424', '4', '5', '4', '', '0', '[\"8\",\"9\",\"12\",\"17\",\"21\",\"26\",\"27\"]', '', '', '', '{}', '1', '*', '1', '0', '783', '2023-09-11 00:00:00', '783', '2023-09