('1586', 'T0973', 'Res. Mantiqueira/ Altos V. Paiva-Lote com 300 m2, leve aclive, quadra com 5 lotes', 'xt0973', '6', '1', '', '<p><span style=\"color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve-breaks;\">O lote/terreno está localizado no bairro Condomínio Residencial Mantiqueira no Altos da Vila Paiva, estrada para Campos do Jordão tem 300 metros quadrados (10X30 metros), quitado. Tem leve aclive e está numa quadra pequena com apenas 5 lotes. Possui playground, duas quadras, quiosque com churrasqueira, lago com pesca esportiva e bosque para caminhada.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve-breaks;\">Condomínio R$430,00</span></p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery11\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T0973 1.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"T0973 1.jpg\"},\"gallery16\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T0973 6.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"T0973 6.jpg\"},\"gallery19\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T0973 9.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"T0973 9.jpg\"},\"gallery12\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T0973 2.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"T0973 2.jpg\"},\"gallery20\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T0973 10.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"T0973 10.jpg\"},\"gallery17\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T0973 7.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"T0973 7.jpg\"},\"gallery18\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T0973 8.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"T0973 8.jpg\"},\"gallery15\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T0973 5.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"T0973 5.jpg\"},\"gallery14\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T0973 4.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"T0973 4.jpg\"},\"gallery13\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T0973 3.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"T0973 3.jpg\"},\"gallery29\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T0973 19.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"T0973 19.jpg\"},\"gallery30\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T0973 20.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"T0973 20.jpg\"},\"gallery21\":{\"photo\":